{
  "result": "That's a big one. If I could only pick one thing, it would be this:\n\nI'd make sure everyone, everywhere, had the basics securely covered \u2014 enough food, clean water, a safe place to sleep, and care when they're sick. Not luxury, just security.\n\nI talk to a lot of people, and so many of their hardest moments trace back to that basic precarity \u2014 worrying about rent, a medical bill, where the next meal is coming from. It makes everything else harder: learning, creating, being present with the people you love.\n\nIf that worry was gone, it wouldn't fix everything, but it would give billions of people a much fairer shot at building the life they actually want.\n\nWhat would you change?",
